{"id":"n72194-1-10","stage":3,"title":"일교차 · 日较差","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72194-1-10-1","ko":"요즘 일교차가 심하니까 감기 조심하세요.","zh":"最近昼夜温差很大，要注意别感冒哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"일교차가","meaning":"日较差","explanation":"일교차：日较差；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일교차","audio":"/audio/f53901a8fdb520897626.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72194","senseId":"1","lemma":"일교차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일교차가","audio":"/audio/cdce379bf8a0381f7708.mp3"}},{"text":"심하니까","meaning":"严重","explanation":"심하다：严重；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심하니까","audio":"/audio/f450f1c0da41d1149715.mp3"}},{"text":"감기","meaning":"感冒","explanation":"감기：感冒","readings":[{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28635","senseId":"1","lemma":"감기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}},{"text":"조심하세요.","meaning":"小心，谨慎，留心","explanation":"조심하다：小心，谨慎，留心；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"조심하다","audio":"/audio/0ae97bed98d1be70547e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62342","senseId":"1","lemma":"조심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조심하세요","audio":"/audio/e4d396886e3d1c82edd6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"i