:[{"entryId":"66104","senseId":"1","lemma":"쌀쌀하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쌀쌀한데","audio":"/audio/e57deeb7ddada284fde4.mp3"}},{"text":"낮에는","meaning":"白天，白日，日间","explanation":"낮：白天，白日，日间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"낮","audio":"/audio/cde379a91768ef6117a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64497","senseId":"1","lemma":"낮","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낮에는","audio":"/audio/0b6a25fe712926052ff4.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써부터","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써부터","audio":"/audio/23ff8caf94dc3d12e2b1.mp3"}},{"text":"덥더라고요.","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"덥더라고요","audio":"/audio/2b36d840fd0eed92370d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"86c4cc835736d415","term":"쌀쌀하다","zh":"凉飕飕","audio":"/audio/86c4cc835736d4151f83.mp3","entryId":"66104","definition":"天气凉，感觉稍冷。","pronunciation":["쌀쌀하다"]},{"id":"cde379a91768ef61","term":"낮","zh":"白天，白日，日间","audio":"/audio/cde379a91768ef6117a6.mp3","entryId":"64497","definition":"从天亮到天黑